  "Bitrate Hauptstream": "Main stream bitrate",
  "Der 1/2,8-Zoll-Sensor liefert saubere Details bei Tag und geringer Restbeleuchtung.": "The 1/2.8-inch sensor delivers clean detail by day and in low residual light.",
